.TH XCALIBER 1
.SH NAME
xcaliber \- space combat game
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B temple/xcaliber
.SH DESCRIPTION
.I XCaliber
is a space combat game.
It runs under
.IR wm (1).
.PP
Turn, thrust, and fire in mass-spring space combat under a chase camera.
.PP
The controls are:
.TF space
.TP
.B Left / a
Turn left
.TP
.B Right / d
Turn right
.TP
.B Up / w
Thrust
.TP
.B space
Fire
.TP
.B Enter
Restart
.TP
.B Esc / q
Quit
.PD
.SH SOURCE
.B /appl/temple/xcaliber.b
.SH SEE ALSO
.IR temple (1),
.IR draw3d (2),
.IR ode (2),
.IR tone (2),
.IR wm (1)
